WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
- Do your parents listen to your podcast?

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.257
- They do now.
- They're trying, well yes.

00:00:04.257 --> 00:00:06.740
- We had to teach them
how to download a podcast

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.573
'cause they'd never

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:08.484
done it before.
- Oh, I didn't even

00:00:08.484 --> 00:00:09.317
think about that.
- Yeah.

00:00:09.317 --> 00:00:12.030
- Yeah, they do now.
- I called home and my mom,

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.060
I was like, "Mom, what are you doing?"

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.520
And she said, "I'm watching
your podcast on YouTube."

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.947
And I said, "Mom, we're not on YouTube."

00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:20.490
"Well, yes you are."

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.140
And I was like, I called my sister Janet.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.000
I was like, "where do you
have Mom on the internet?"

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.180
Be careful, because you know YouTube--

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.898
- You find stuff on there.
- But we're not,

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:30.063
we're not on YouTube.
- You can put all of us

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.900
ladies in, and you never know

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.733
what's gonna come up.
- You never know.

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:34.748
I was like, "don't let
Mom search YouTube."

00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:36.837
- (laughing) I just picture it.

00:00:36.837 --> 00:00:38.350
That's amazing.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.380
So this is your mom,

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.470
was that your mom watching?
- Oh, this is it.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.013
- Oh yeah, we made a video

00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:42.846
of ourselves--
- That was my mom

00:00:42.846 --> 00:00:43.910
and my sister, Janet.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.000
- Teaching our family how
to download a podcast.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.720
- You can't watch the podcast on YouTube.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:50.390
- Is your sound on your phone?

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:51.923
Is your sound on?

00:00:51.923 --> 00:00:53.986
♪ Da da da da, da da da da ♪

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:55.050
- Oh, my god.
- What were you guys watching?

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.910
- Wesley or something like that.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.440
- So I'm gonna teach you
how to download a podcast.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.430
- We got a pen and a paper,
we're gonna write it down.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.080
- Where's Mom going?

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.850
- Oh my gosh, I love, there
should be a show about that.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:09.360
Just older people getting into technology,

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.460
I would watch that.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.670
- Well, the first time
my mom sent me an email,

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:14.697
she called me and she
said, "why haven't you

00:01:14.697 --> 00:01:15.850
"responded to my email?"

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:17.237
And I said, "well, what email did you,

00:01:17.237 --> 00:01:18.360
"address did you send it to?"

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.323
And she said, "well, it
said to, and I wrote Jenna."

00:01:21.323 --> 00:01:22.156
(audience laughing)

00:01:22.156 --> 00:01:23.243
- Just find her.
- Just Jenna.

00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:25.810
- Just find her.
- Not even at anything.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.880
Just Jenna, she wrote a
long letter and hit send.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.527
I was like, "Mom, it
doesn't work like that.

00:01:31.527 --> 00:01:32.810
"I never got it."

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:34.960
- Oh my god, I love it.
- I would do that.

